   "id": "intro",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🔍 YOLO Hardware Requirements Profiler\n",
    "**All versions: YOLOv1 → YOLOv10 + Fast-YOLO**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook profiles:\n",
    "- **FLOPs** (Floating Point Operations) — compute cost per forward pass\n",
    "- **Parameters** — model size / memory footprint\n",
    "- **MACs** (Multiply-Accumulate Operations)\n",
    "- **Estimated GPU VRAM** usage\n",
    "- **Throughput** (FPS) on CPU and GPU (if available)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### 📋 Run Order\n",
    "1. **Cell 1** — Install dependencies  \n",
    "2. **Cell 2** — Define all YOLO architectures (v1–v10 + Fast-YOLO)  \n",
    "3. **Cell 3** — Run FLOP profiler  \n",
    "4. **Cell 4** — Benchmark throughput  \n",
    "5. **Cell 5** — Visualise results  \n",
    "6. **Cell 6** — Export to CSV / JSON  "
   ]
  },
